  "definition": "Transfer of Limited Commercial and Commercial Lobster License",
  "effectiveDate": "2015-09-14",
  "historyNote": "#6916, eff 12-22-98; ss by #8303, EXEMPT, eff 4-1-05; amd by #8819, EXEMPT, eff 2-1-07; ss by #9014, EXEMPT, eff 1-1-08; ss by #10160, EXEMPT, eff 7-16-12; ss by #10930, EXEMPT, eff 9-14-15",
